<title>USA: Enterprise Rent-A-Car pulls into corp debt arena.</title>
<headline>Enterprise Rent-A-Car pulls into corp debt arena.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterprise Rent-A-Car is gearing up to tap the corporate bond new issue market with a $250 million private placement debt offering one day this week, syndicate sources said.</p>
<p>The deal, which is expected to consist of seven-year 144A notes, will be underwritten by Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, sources added.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
</text>
